  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bangladesh floods response EA22/2015</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Poor and vulnerable families affected by recurring floods, landslides as a result of damage caused by cyclone Komen in Cox&#x2019;s Bazar and Bandarban Districts recovered their basic needs.

2858 households in 12 unions receive support enabling them to compensate for physical assets and economic opportunities lost due to floods during period from August 2015 to January 2016 through unconditional cash transfer and support to reconstruct latrines and promote good hygiene practices.</narrative>
  </description>
